<div class="CEURTOC">
<h2> Table of Contents </h2>


<ul>
   <li id="preface">
      <A href="preface.pdf" target="_blank"> Preface</A><br>
      This volume contains the <span class="CEURACCEPTEDPAPERS">392</span> working notes that were peer-reviewed and accepted for publication at CLEF 2025. Out of these, 38 are overviews of the labs and tasks, while 354 are the participants' working notes.
   </li>
</ul>
<br>

